.Dd August 20, 2026
.Dt FILEES-WORKER 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm filees-worker
.Nd execute one authenticated FileES server action and exit
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is exec'd once per authenticated deploy or control-plane ticket.
It is
.Sy root : wheel
mode 0555 and has no resident service.
The next operation execs the current image.
.Pp
It is the only process that mutates canonical service-repository records,
data repositories, grants, editing policy and Public Shares channel
state.
It publishes through a path-scoped Subversion commit under the shared
service-WC lock.
Unversioned leftovers from a killed older binary are reconciled before
the next scan.
.Pp
In Whale mode it serves one framed PUT window, status or commit request.
It keeps the exact durable offset and immutable generation identity in a
server-owned journal, checks the current client projection, and publishes
only through
.Cm svnmucc
to the reserved
.Pa .filees-whales
namespace.
The worker establishes its own restricted filesystem profile
after the gated session child execs it.
.Pp
Do not run
.Nm
as root against the service working copy.
Root can bypass the 0700 directory mode and then leaves root-owned
pristine objects in
.Pa .svn .
.Pp
.Nm
.Cm upload-reap
is the operator exception to the one-shot deploy contract.
It claims ready intake jobs, runs
.Ic upload.av_command ,
and commits a clean payload into
.Ic upload_repo
or copies a rejected payload into the trash tree.
Run it as
.Sy _filees-state ,
never as root:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
* * * * * /usr/local/libexec/filees/filees-worker upload-reap -config /etc/filees/server.json >/dev/null
.Ed
The installer does not install that crontab.
Intake job directories are
.Cm 0770
.Sy _filees-links : _filees-public
so
.Sy _filees-state
(a member of
.Sy _filees-public )
can read them.
.Ic av_command
runs as the reaper user and must be able to open the payload;
.Nm clamscan
does that,
.Nm clamdscan
does not unless
.Sy _clamav
can also read the job directory.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr filees-client-entry 8 ,
.Xr filees-entry 8 ,
.Xr filees-service-wc-corrector 8 ,
.Xr filees.conf 5
